ate"><addressbook><name>WATANABE, TAKUO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMASHIKI, YUKA</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A colored polymer thin film has an average refractive index ranging from 1.60 to 1.90 and a double refractive index the absolute value of which is less than 0.01.  A color filter comprising such a colored polymer thin film and having a reduced retardation and a liquid crystal display also comprising such a colored polymer thin film and exhibiting excellent display characteristics are also disclosed.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Une feuille mince de polymère coloré possède un indice de réfraction moyen compris entre 1,60 et 1,90 et un double indice de réfraction dont la valeur absolue est inférieure à 0,01. L'invention porte également sur un filtre coloré comprenant ladite feuille mince de polymère coloré et induisant un retard réduit, sur un affichage à cristaux liquides comportant également ladite feuille de polymère coloré et présentant d'excellentes caractéristiques d'affichage.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>